{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118451","id":4246514847,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HKyf","number":118451,"title":"CharacterBody2D missing ObjectDB lifetime check for platform_rid (use-after-free)","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:26:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:08Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\n`CharacterBody2D::_apply_floor_snap()` calls `PhysicsServer2D::get_singleton()->body_get_direct_state(platform_rid)` on a potentially freed body. The 3D version (`CharacterBody3D`) has an explicit `ObjectDB::get_instance()` lifetime guard that the 2D version lacks.\n\n**CharacterBody2D (scene/2d/physics/character_body_2d.cpp:59-68) — NO guard:**\n```cpp\nif ((on_floor || on_wall) && platform_rid.is_valid()) {\n    // ...\n    if (!excluded) {\n        PhysicsDirectBodyState2D *bs = PhysicsServer2D::get_singleton()->body_get_direct_state(platform_rid);\n        if (bs) {\n```\n\n**CharacterBody3D (scene/3d/physics/character_body_3d.cpp:75) — HAS guard:**\n```cpp\nif (platform_object_id.is_null() || ObjectDB::get_instance(platform_object_id)) {\n    bs = PhysicsServer3D::get_singleton()->body_get_direct_state(platform_rid);\n}\n```\n\nA valid RID does not guarantee the underlying physics object still exists. The body could have been freed between frames, making `body_get_direct_state()` return a dangling pointer or crash.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a CharacterBody2D standing on a moving platform.\n2. Free the platform body via `queue_free()` while the character is snapping to it.\n3. The 2D version can crash; the 3D version handles it correctly.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — the missing guard is directly visible by comparing the 2D and 3D implementations.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118451/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}